				<r3d:description language="eng">&lt;&lt;&lt;!!!&lt;&lt;&lt; As of June 2026, the KADoNiS-p database appears to be offline. See https://exp-astro.physik.uni-frankfurt.de/kadonis1.0/index.php &gt;&gt;&gt;!!!&gt;&gt;&gt;

KADoNiS-p database:
The KADoNiS project is an online database for cross sections relevant to the s-process and p-process (γ-process). The present p-process library includes all available experimental data from (p,γ), (p,n), (α,γ), (α,n), and (α,p) reactions between 70Ge and 209Bi in or close to the respective Gamow window.</r3d:description>
